#. module: account_peppol_response
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_peppol_response
msgid ""
"\n"
"In addition to the PEPPOL module, this enable the business level response "
"mechanism for PEPPOL documents.\n"
"When sending a document, and if the counterpart also handles business "
"responses, you will be able to\n"
"see if your document has been accepted or rejected.\n"
"When receiving a document, you will be able to send a rejection or approval "
"of the received document.\n"
msgstr ""

